edback helps a lot as development continues.Thank you for your support.– Grape Soda Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T16:03:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3408160-1827626365760595","game_id":"steam-3408160","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cactus Flats Demo is Now Available","summary":"The Cactus Flats demo is now live on Steam.Step into the frontier and try the opening slice of the game for yourself. Build your farm, manage your crops, and survive an economy that can turn against you fast.In the demo, you can:plant, water, grow, and harvest cropsbuy and sell through a shifting marketlearn the early systems that drive survival on the farmget a feel for the pressure and decision-making at the heart of Cactus FlatsIf you’ve been following the game, now’s the time to jump in and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-21T18:53:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365760595","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3408160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3408160":"2026-10-26T00:40:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3408160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4512240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3408160","app_id":3408160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-2